what he did is still 100 % wrong.

248
00:15:13,760 --> 00:15:16,217
Someone's got to hold
him accountable for that.

249
00:15:16,300 --> 00:15:19,580
In this case, it looks
like it's up to us, too.

250
00:15:20,280 --> 00:15:21,110
Right.

251
00:15:21,340 --> 00:15:23,020
We'll go and sort this out.

252
00:15:25,600 --> 00:15:26,600
Well, well.

253
00:15:27,580 --> 00:15:31,360
To what do we owe the pleasure
of this visit, Disciple Eugeo?

254
00:15:31,920 --> 00:15:34,900
And on the evening of
our day of rest, no less.

255
00:15:35,100 --> 00:15:37,335
I've come to report a troubling rumor.

256
00:15:38,760 --> 00:15:41,420
Unfortunately, it concerns Disciple Zizek.

257
00:15:41,600 --> 00:15:46,541
I thought I'd bring this to your attention
before it damaged his stellar reputation.

258
00:15:46,800 --> 00:15:47,960
Are you mocking me?

259
00:15:48,240 --> 00:15:49,500
Oh, my.

260
00:15:49,900 --> 00:15:51,720
I must say, I'm surprised.

261
00:15:51,860 --> 00:15:54,097
I wouldn't have expected this from you.

262
00:15:54,180 --> 00:15:58,651
How thoughtful of you to be concerned
for the sake of my friend's good name.

263
00:15:58,880 --> 00:16:03,460
However, I'm afraid I have no idea
what this rumor you speak of could be.

264
00:16:08,120 --> 00:16:10,097
Along with the nature of these claims,

265
00:16:10,180 --> 00:16:12,877
I must ask where you
acquired this information.

266
00:16:12,960 --> 00:16:16,666
From Lord Zizek's page, along
with the girls who room with her.

267
00:16:16,920 --> 00:16:18,979
As far as the claims are concerned,

268
00:16:19,100 --> 00:16:23,300
they say Lord Zizek has been
issuing perverse orders to his page.

269
00:16:24,540 --> 00:16:27,020
Franika, what are these perverse orders?

270
00:16:27,360 --> 00:16:30,772
I'm not following what it is
you're getting at, Sir Eugeo.

271
00:16:30,860 --> 00:16:34,580
Which of the school's regulations
has he violated specifically?

272
00:16:37,900 --> 00:16:38,730
Sir,

273
00:16:38,980 --> 00:16:41,877
even if something isn't
specifically forbidden here,

274
00:16:41,960 --> 00:16:44,297
do you not agree there are
things an elite disciple

275
00:16:44,380 --> 00:16:47,086
should never do as a
primary trainee's mentor?

276
00:16:47,200 --> 00:16:50,077
Oh, I can tell this upsets you.

277
00:16:50,160 --> 00:16:55,120
Now then, what exactly are you
insinuating Umber forced Fronica to do?

278
00:16:55,280 --> 00:16:56,520
I couldn't say.

279
00:16:57,720 --> 00:16:59,500
Well, what say you, Umber?

280
00:16:59,840 --> 00:17:03,605
Do you have any idea what it is
Sir Eugeo could be referring to?

281
00:17:05,400 --> 00:17:07,140
Not even the foggiest!

282
00:17:07,360 --> 00:17:10,580
Try as I might, I can't
make heads nor tails of it.

283
00:17:10,840 --> 00:17:14,720
It is true that I asked her to
perform some menial tasks for me.

284
00:17:14,860 --> 00:17:19,017
But ever since my duel with Sir Eugeo,
which regrettably ended in a draw,

285
00:17:19,100 --> 00:17:22,577
I'm a changed man and have
immersed myself fully in

286
00:17:22,660 --> 00:17:26,057
my training why I've been
using muscles I did not know

287
00:17:26,140 --> 00:17:30,657
I had and as a result my
body ached so badly in such

288
00:17:30,740 --> 00:17:33,697
a humbled state as I was
in I had no choice but to

289
00:17:33,780 --> 00:17:37,657
ask her to massage me every
night while I bathed I was

290
00:17:37,740 --> 00:17:40,757
concerned she would soil
her uniform so I graciously

291
00:17:40,840 --> 00:17:43,637
had her stripped down and
massage me in her undergarments

292
00:17:43,720 --> 00:17:46,517
honestly I can't for the
life of me understand?

293
00:17:46,600 --> 00:17:49,200
how anyone could think that perverse.

294
00:17:52,720 --> 00:17:54,480
Because of your behavior,

295
00:17:55,380 --> 00:17:57,237
Frenika has been beside herself.

296
00:17:57,320 --> 00:17:59,180
If you continue harassing her,

297
00:17:59,940 --> 00:18:01,717
I will be forced to bring
it to the attention?

298
00:18:01,800 --> 00:18:02,918
of our instructors.

299
00:18:03,220 --> 00:18:05,360
I hope you understand. Why you!

300
00:18:10,080 --> 00:18:12,980
I appreciate the warning, Disciple Eugeo.

301
00:18:13,600 --> 00:18:15,620
Do whatever you feel is right.

302
00:18:19,080 --> 00:18:21,021
Don't let those jerks get to you.

303
00:18:21,240 --> 00:18:23,500
I don't know how you kept so calm.

304
00:18:23,700 --> 00:18:26,171
I thought I was going to lose it in there.

305
00:18:26,280 --> 00:18:29,200
Lucky for them, you didn't
have your sword. Well,

306
00:18:29,480 --> 00:18:33,817
at least now I'm pretty sure they're up
to something more than just being creeps.

307
00:18:33,900 --> 00:18:34,730
What?

308
00:18:34,813 --> 00:18:36,677
I get the feeling the reason they're going

309
00:18:36,760 --> 00:18:39,377
to all this trouble is
to set a trap for you.

310
00:18:39,460 --> 00:18:40,477
Really? Yeah.

311
00:18:40,560 --> 00:18:44,640
Look, if you'd taken their bait
and started going off on Humber,

312
00:18:44,940 --> 00:18:48,277
they could have accused you of
being disrespectful to them,

313
00:18:48,360 --> 00:18:50,637
and they'd be in their
rights to punish you.

314
00:18:50,720 --> 00:18:51,550
You see?

315
00:18:55,780 --> 00:18:56,610
Don't worry.

316
00:18:56,693 --> 00:18:59,875
If Humber doesn't stop messing
with Fronica, he'll pay.

317
00:19:00,020 --> 00:19:02,608
For now, all we can do
is tell the teachers.

318
00:19:02,700 --> 00:19:04,935
So stay sharp and keep your eyes open.

319
00:19:06,000 --> 00:19:07,860
All right, I'll do that.

320
00:19:08,480 --> 00:19:11,997
And you, Gio, if those guys say
anything to you when I'm not around,

321
00:19:12,080 --> 00:19:15,097
try not to get yourself all
riled up like you did back there.

322
00:19:15,180 --> 00:19:16,560
I won't, I promise.

323
00:19:16,940 --> 00:19:19,080
I'll just, you know, stay cool.

324
00:19:20,140 --> 00:19:20,970
Exactly.

325
00:19:21,053 --> 00:19:22,500
Stay cool. Always.

326
00:19:24,520 --> 00:19:26,180
Allow me to make my report.

327
00:19:27,820 --> 00:19:29,160
All chores are done.

328
00:19:29,460 --> 00:19:31,957
The assigned cleaning
has also been completed.

329
00:19:32,040 --> 00:19:33,800
Good work, as usual.

330
00:19:34,080 --> 00:19:35,477
I really appreciate it.

331
00:19:35,560 --> 00:19:37,913
Oh, it's nothing on your page after all!

332
00:19:38,180 --> 00:19:42,720
By the way, if you have the time, I'd
like to talk to you about something.

333
00:19:43,440 --> 00:19:44,860
You don't have to stand.

334
00:19:45,120 --> 00:19:46,120
Please, sit down.

335
00:19:54,100 --> 00:19:55,980
Very well, if you insist.

336
00:20:08,480 --> 00:20:09,740
It's about Frenika.

337
00:20:10,080 --> 00:20:12,668
I had a talk with Umber
about her yesterday.

338
00:20:12,880 --> 00:20:13,762
Did you really?

339
00:20:14,040 --> 00:20:16,480
I doubt he wants to get into any trouble,

340
00:20:16,720 --> 00:20:20,840
so I'm pretty sure he won't be
harassing her anymore. Thank goodness.

341
00:20:21,460 --> 00:20:25,166
You don't know how grateful I
am, Elite Disciple Yu-Gi-Oh, sir.

342
00:20:25,540 --> 00:20:29,069
Your work's done for today, so
please just call me Yu-Gi-Oh.

343
00:20:29,880 --> 00:20:32,821
Anyway, there's something
I need to apologize for.

344
00:20:33,740 --> 00:20:37,640
I wasn't sure of it
yesterday, but now I am.

345
00:20:38,240 --> 00:20:40,497
The reason this happened
in the first place

346
00:20:40,580 --> 00:20:43,720
was all because of the
duel I had with Umber.

347
00:20:44,380 --> 00:20:47,900
Do you think you could set
up a meeting with her for me?

348
00:20:48,300 --> 00:20:50,420
I'd like to apologize in person.

349
00:20:54,220 --> 00:20:55,700
Yes, of course.

350
00:20:56,480 --> 00:20:59,997
Honestly, despite what you say,
none of this is really your fault.

351
00:21:00,080 --> 00:21:04,139
But I'll be more than happy to convey
your wishes to her nonetheless.

352
00:21:06,500 --> 00:21:07,817
Um, could I...

353
00:21:07,900 --> 00:21:10,500
Could I sit closer to you?

354
00:21:12,760 --> 00:21:14,060
Uh, sure.

355
00:21:22,400 --> 00:21:25,920
I've been thinking, after I
graduate from the academy,

356
00:21:26,820 --> 00:21:29,526
I'll take over as head
of the Streenan family.

357
00:21:30,520 --> 00:21:31,350
As is custom,

358
00:21:31,433 --> 00:21:35,889
I will then have to marry a noble who
is of the same rank or possibly higher.

359
00:21:39,400 --> 00:21:40,980
And it terrifies me!

360
00:21:41,940 --> 00:21:46,620
What if the man who becomes my husband
turns out to be someone like Lord Zizek?

361
00:21:47,460 --> 00:21:50,377
Someone who is cruel to
others and who lacks the basic

362
00:21:50,460 --> 00:21:53,401
principles of honor my
father raised me to uphold.

363
00:21:53,600 --> 00:21:54,840
I'm so scared.

364
00:21:55,860 --> 00:21:56,880
What do I do?

365
00:22:07,500 --> 00:22:08,330
Tiese.

366
00:22:08,413 --> 00:22:13,500
Yujiyo, if it would be alright, I'd
like to ask another favor of you.

367
00:22:13,900 --> 00:22:18,080
I have no doubt that eventually
you'll rise to the top of our class,

368
00:22:18,300 --> 00:22:20,077
win the swordsmanship tournament,

369
00:22:20,160 --> 00:22:23,336
and compete in the Fort
Empire Unification Tournament.

370
00:22:23,600 --> 00:22:24,640
I hope to.

371
00:22:24,900 --> 00:22:27,917
I mean, I am working
hard toward that goal.

372
00:22:28,000 --> 00:22:30,940
And then, after that,

373
00:22:31,240 --> 00:22:36,220
if you, if you rank high in
the Unification Tournament,

374
00:22:36,520 --> 00:22:38,940
I heard you can be appointed as a noble.

375
00:22:39,280 --> 00:22:41,557
That's what happened
with our supervisor, Ms.

376
00:22:41,640 --> 00:22:42,470
Asurika.

377
00:22:43,440 --> 00:22:49,260
And then, if you do decide to take a
title, do you think, would you be my...

378
00:22:53,160 --> 00:22:55,042
I'm not here for the tournament.

379
00:22:56,340 --> 00:22:59,869
I'm doing this to become an
Integrity Knight and find Alice.

380
00:23:00,380 --> 00:23:02,000
But I can't tell her that.

381
00:23:07,040 --> 00:23:07,900
It's okay.

382
00:23:08,480 --> 00:23:11,362
After the tournament,
we'll talk more about this.

383
00:23:12,700 --> 00:23:13,800
I'll be waiting.

384
00:23:14,580 --> 00:23:16,420
And I'll work as hard as you.

385
00:23:17,040 --> 00:23:18,837
I want to become strong enough.

386
00:23:18,920 --> 00:23:21,560
So that I can speak up for what is right.

387
00:23:23,080 --> 00:23:24,617
Just like you, Yujiya.

388
00:23:24,700 --> 00:23:27,560
They are least to you.
